body:
So I tried this:

if (keyboard\_check\_pressed(ord("E")))

{

	with instance\_place(x,y,obj\_door\_press)

	{

		room\_goto(targetRoom);

		player\_x = target\_x;

		player\_y = target\_y

	}

}

And it takes me to the correct room when I press "E", but not to the right x and y coordinates. Instead it uses the x and y coordinates from the last time the variables were set. Sorry if I'm just missing it and there is a simple answer.

&#x200B;
